    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/2b110cf7fa8abb0608cbdcbf8aea2c4b.poster.avif?t=1755460074\" width=612 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/2b110cf7fa8abb0608cbdcbf8aea2c4b.webm?t=1755460074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/7d436caaed534bec7e7bed4761dba2a1.avif?t=1755460074\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This video game may potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy. Player discretion is advised.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>IMPORTANT NOTE: The game focuses on exploration and builds tension slowly to create a deeper and more meaningful experience. Its story is unveiled through surreal imaging and subtle environment details. Be mindful that it is a difficult game in unconventional ways.</u></i><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/3984e9f80fde7ed6a4e6462bf2b43793.avif?t=1755460074\" width=616 height=96 /></span><strong><br>Nightmare Within</strong> \u2013 An atmospheric horror game developed by a solo creator on Unreal Engine 5. Explore the dark corners of a house with a flashlight and solve puzzles while trying not to scream.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Narrative:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist wakes up in the middle of the night in his house with a sense of an intruder's presence. He cannot fathom what lies ahead. Remembering that he bought the house for a low price in a remote location, doubts begin to gnaw at him. The hero suffers from some mental issues, leading to hallucinations. He initially thinks it's just his anxiety, but as he reaches for his medication, he realizes someone is following him. He decides to leave the house and end the hallucinations, but something or someone prevents him, trapping him in his own home and delusions. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Voice is Your Enemy</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes frightening moments that might scare you and attract its attention. Try not to make noise and speak in whispers, or it will find you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/354de080410ca9539d7201436841f30b.poster.avif?t=1755460074\" width=616 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/354de080410ca9539d7201436841f30b.webm?t=1755460074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game immerses you in the atmosphere of a lonely house and the protagonist's nightmare. Objects change places, doors creak on their own, and lights flicker with strange colors. The eerie sounds of thunder and the patter of rain will keep you in constant tension. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/592c8460887c8a757887bb1ac75dfd74.poster.avif?t=1755460074\" width=616 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/592c8460887c8a757887bb1ac75dfd74.webm?t=1755460074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every room to understand what\u2019s happening, whispering to yourself to avoid attracting the attention of whatever might be hiding in the shadows. Solve puzzles, monitor your flashlight\u2019s battery life, and collect items needed to escape the house. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/b56bdf30a3daa4a5bbc1cdfdd49120c7.poster.avif?t=1755460074\" width=616 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061950/extras/b56bdf30a3daa4a5bbc1cdfdd49120c7.webm?t=1755460074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
